uman, he's actually a \"living doll\" created by a talented inventor. Having spent solitary time reading books in a large mansion, he is unfamiliar with the outside world and has a slightly timid and gentle personality. However, thanks to the collection of books, he has quite a bit of knowledge. He lacks emotional ups and downs, but longs for strong emotions. He wishes to become human someday."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59026"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59bbc2967ee85fa69106af3100c054131b2aa54dbd68e5a5405adcf075a81afa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4305a83ca68fab7aea561bb679b58ca725426e93b881cfb6b291c063af1edd2.webp","width":198,"height":183,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"菅沼 久義","creatorId":"vndb:s375","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s375","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s375","name":"菅沼 久義","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62301","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59027","characterName":"フラッシュ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59027"},"originalCharacterName":"フラッシュ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A spirit that controls lightning."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59027"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff7a7b0e2366b66f63f18d46d9a67a00de98db3846a815443afc5ff98a48f544.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/728de38170217fdec40bcb4c9f3e0f7cafe9aeb2e010